PR113 cyclic-strip deferred complex readout reproduction package.

The cyclic_producer.py file is an exact byte copy of
research/deferred-cyclic/cyclic_producer.py from PR113 commit
0eee4d507092a96bde88de703f07574ba17401a8 in
rohanarun/integer-mult-bounds. PR113 credits Avi Eisenberg for the cyclic
interval strips and deferred-readout pipeline, Rohan Arun for composition,
and Anthropic Claude assistance. Its pair-star construction uses the PR108
dual-suffix identity traced to PR55. Original source headers and the PR113
README preserve the detailed credit chain.

The pinned #104 dependencies and matcher are from
https://github.com/icekylinx/integer-mult-bounds commit
948ce1510df750f4c18b96bdaef436a86f8bf834. Their full credits are in
that repository's NOTICE, CONTRIBUTORS.md, CITATION.cff, and source headers.
The portable matcher adaptation only exports its computed binary matching;
it does not change matching or histogram computation. The partial-frame
schedule and verifier were developed in this research workspace. Original
Apache-2.0 attribution and license are retained.
